#Start Chaper
label ch2sc25:

    #play music morning_1

    # start scene 2
        window hide dissolve
        play music summon_2 fadein 2.0
        scene black with Dissolve (2.0)
        $ renpy.pause(1)
        scene ss92 with Dissolve (2.0)
        $ renpy.pause()
        scene ch2sc25_01 with Dissolve(2.0)
        $ renpy.pause(1)
        scene ch2sc25_02 with dissolve
        $ renpy.pause()
        scene ch2sc25_03 with dissolve
        mc "Hm?"
        scene ch2sc25_04 with dissolve
        el "I still can’t believe we actually met a dwarf!"
        el "A dwarf! We really are living out an adventure from my mothers books!"
        scene ch2sc25_05 with dissolve
        mc "From what Borri said, I don’t think they are that uncommon."
        mc "I guess we’ve just lived sheltered lives in Riverside and Whitehills."
        mc "Now that I think about it... I did see a dwarf back in Riverside, at the tavern."
        scene ch2sc25_06 with dissolve
        el "I wonder if other things from my mothers books are also real?"
        scene ch2sc25_07 with dissolve
        mc "The things I saw while traveling with your father..."
        mc "I'd say they're all real until proven otherwise."
        scene ch2sc25_08 with dissolve
        el "Wait, really?! That’s so exciting!"
        el "And a little terrifying at the same time..."
        scene ch2sc25_09 with dissolve
        el "There was some pretty dark stuff in some of the books."
        el "Black magic, corrupt witches, living dead, trolls kidnapping people, goblins raping wome-"
        el "You get the idea... awful stuff."
        scene ch2sc25_10 with dissolve
        mc "Hmm, I haven’t encountered any of those things. Except for goblins, that one I can confirm to be true."
        mc "As for the other stuff, stories have to start somewhere, so I’m sure there’s some truth to them."
        scene ch2sc25_11 with dissolve
        el "Hmm, makes sense."
        el "At least now we’ve had our first encounter with a non-human!"
        scene ch2sc25_12 with dissolve
        mc "You’re awfully excited about that?"
        scene ch2sc25_13 with dissolve
        el "Of course! You should be too!"
        el "It marks the real beginning of our path as adventurers, [mc]!"
        scene ch2sc25_14 with dissolve
        mc "I suppose you’re right."
        mc "*Chuckles* Who would’ve thought?"
        scene ch2sc25_15 with dissolve
        el "Thought what?"
        el "Did you think of something?"
        scene ch2sc25_16 with dissolve
        mc "Oh, it's nothing."
        mc "Just a memory... from a long time ago."
        scene ch2sc25_15 with dissolve
        el "Now you have to tell me."
        el "Please?"
        scene ch2sc25_16 with dissolve
        mc "*Sigh* I was just remembering that when I was younger..."
        mc "I always dreamed of becoming an adventurer."
        scene ch2sc25_17 with dissolve
        elt "Oh! I get it."
        scene ch2sc25_18 with dissolve
        elt "It must feel strange to be living his “Dream”..."
        elt "But not in the way that he'd imagined."
        elt "D-Does he think the version we're living is worse than the one from his childhood dreams?"
        scene ch2sc25_16 with dissolve
        mc "I would always pester Papa about being old enough to travel and train with swords."
        scene ch2sc25_19 with dissolve
        el "I guess he wasn’t thrilled with the idea?"
        el "His son wanting to venture out in the world on his own, every parents worst nightmare."
        scene ch2sc25_20 with dissolve
        mc "That’s an understatement."
        mc "Mama wasn’t happy about it either, but she usually took my side."
        scene ch2sc25_21 with dissolve
        mc "She wanted me to stay safe."
        mc "Knowing what I know now, about who... what I am..."
        scene ch2sc25_22 with dissolve
        el "{size=+3}{b}Who.{/b}{/size} Not 'what'."
        scene ch2sc25_21 with dissolve
        mc "Who I am now, it made sense they wanted me to stay hidden in Riverside."
        mc "A small village with no connections to the capital."
        scene ch2sc25_23 with dissolve
        el "That didn’t stop you from wanting something more, I take it?"
        scene ch2sc25_24 with dissolve
        mc "No, not quite..."
        mc "It just made me want it even more."
        scene ch2sc25_25 with dissolve
        el "Despite the circumstances, I think young [mc] would be proud of where you are now."
        el "Our lives are only just starting, there's a whole world out there for us to discover."
        scene ch2sc25_26 with dissolve
        mc "Yeah... I think you might be right."
        scene ch2sc25_27 with dissolve
        mc "You know, you’re surprisingly wise when you want to be."
        el "Hrrh??"
        scene ch2sc25_28 with dissolve
        with vpunch
        el "Hey!"
        el "What’s that supposed to mean? I’m wise all the time!"
        scene ch2sc25_29 with dissolve
        mc "Sure, Eliza. {b}All.{/b} {size=+10}{b}The.{/b}{/size} {size=+20}{b}Time.{/b}{/size}"
        scene ch2sc25_30 with dissolve
        el "Hrrh... {b}Jerk!{/b}"
        stop music fadeout 2.0
        scene black with Dissolve(2)
        jump ch2sc26
